284	     * {@link #getRegistrationDate() registration date}: {@code 'MINOR'} when under 18, {@code 'ADULT'}
285	     * when 18 to 64, and {@code 'SENIOR'} when 65 or older. The age is the number of whole years
286	     * elapsed from the birth date to the registration date (defaulting to the server's current date
287	     * when no registration date is set yet). Returns {@code null} when no birth date was supplied.
